module.exports = {"type":"WEBSOCKET","title":"增量深度信息","en":"Incremental Depth Information","info":{"en":[{"type":"div","info":"Push frequency explanation: BTC-USDT and ETH-USDT push frequency is 200ms, while other pairs are 800ms."},{"type":"div","info":"Maintaining a local order book: After subscribing or resubscribing, wait until a full snapshot with action=all is actually received on the connection carrying the active subscription before initializing the local order book. A successful subscription acknowledgement does not mean that the full snapshot has been received."},{"type":"div","info":"When action=all is received during an active subscription, replace the local order book with the bid and ask levels in that message. For action=update, apply updates to the corresponding price levels in message reception order: delete a level when its quantity is zero; otherwise, add the level or replace its quantity. The quantity is the updated quantity at that price level, not a delta to add."},{"type":"div","info":"lastUpdateId is not guaranteed to be consecutive within a single subscription connection. A gap greater than 1 between adjacent message IDs does not by itself indicate missing order book data; increasing IDs alone do not prove data completeness either."},{"type":"div","info":"The current protocol does not provide a previous update ID, an update ID range, or an order book checksum. Clients therefore cannot reliably distinguish ID gaps from missing messages using lastUpdateId alone. Buffering a fixed number of incremental messages cannot guarantee recovery of missing data."},{"type":"div","info":"If the connection is interrupted, a message cannot be parsed, the client drops messages, or the local order book state is no longer trustworthy, stop using that state. The preferred recovery method is to establish a new connection, subscribe, and rebuild only after an action=all full snapshot is actually received on that new connection. Delivery of a full snapshot is not guaranteed; do not treat the local order book as synchronized before it is actually received."},{"type":"div","info":"An action=all message may also arrive after an unsubscribe operation. A snapshot received during the unsubscribe phase must not be treated as successful recovery. Unsubscribe/subscribe acknowledgements alone do not mean recovery is complete, and a snapshot from an old connection must not be used as evidence that the new connection is synchronized."},{"type":"div","info":"Subscription type: dataType should be <symbol>@incrDepth, e.g., BTC-USDT@incrDepth"},{"type":"div","info":"Subscription example: {\"id\":\"975f7385-7f28-4ef1-93af-df01cb9ebb53\",\"reqType\": \"sub\",\"dataType\":\"BTC-USDT@incrDepth\"}"}],"zh":[{"type":"div","info":"推送頻率說明：BTC-USDT和ETH-USDT的推送頻率是200ms，其他幣對的是800ms。"},{"type":"div","info":"本地訂單簿維護：訂閱或重新訂閱後，客戶端應等待當前有效訂閱連接上實際收到 action=all 的全量快照，再初始化本地訂單簿。訂閱成功回執不代表全量快照已經收到。"},{"type":"div","info":"在有效訂閱期間收到 action=all 時，以該消息中的買賣檔位替換本地訂單簿。收到 action=update 時，按消息接收順序更新對應價位：數量為零時刪除該檔位；數量非零時新增或替換該檔位的數量。數量是該價位更新後的數量，不是需要累加的變化量。"},{"type":"div","info":"lastUpdateId 不保證在單個訂閱連接內連續。相鄰消息的編號差大於 1，不能單獨作為丟失盤口數據的依據；編號遞增也不能單獨證明數據完整。"},{"type":"div","info":"當前協議未提供前序更新編號、更新編號範圍或訂單簿校驗和，因此客戶端無法僅憑 lastUpdateId 可靠區分編號跳躍和消息缺失。快取固定數量的增量消息不能保證恢復缺失數據。"},{"type":"div","info":"發生連接中斷、消息解析失敗、客戶端消息丟棄，或本地訂單簿狀態不再可信時，應停止使用該狀態。恢復時優先重新建立連接並訂閱，等待該新連接上實際收到 action=all 的全量快照後再重建。不保證全量快照必定送達；未實際收到前，不應將本地訂單簿視為已同步。"},{"type":"div","info":"退訂操作後也可能收到 action=all，因此不能把退訂階段收到的快照當作恢復成功。不能僅憑退訂／訂閱回執認定恢復完成，也不能用舊連接上的快照作為新連接已同步的依據。"},{"type":"div","info":"訂閱類型：dataType應為<symbol>@incrDepth，例如：BTC-USDT@incrDepth"},{"type":"div","info":"訂閱例子：{\"id\":\"975f7385-7f28-4ef1-93af-df01cb9ebb53\",\"reqType\": \"sub\",\"dataType\":\"BTC-USDT@incrDepth\"}"}]},"api":{"topic":{},"payload":{"id":"e745cd6d-d0f6-4a70-8d5a-043e4c741b40","reqType":"sub","dataType":"BTC-USDT@incrDepth"},"unsub_payload":{"id":"24dd0e35-56a4-4f7a-af8a-394c7060909c","reqType":"unsub","dataType":"BTC-USDT@incrDepth"},"responseBo