module.exports = {"type":"REST","title":"交易時段","en":"Trading Schedule","api":{"uri":"/openApi/swap/v1/quote/tradingSchedule","method":"GET","requiresAuth":false,"environments":["PROD"],"rate-limitation":"","ip-rate-limit":"500/10s","payload":{"symbol":"NCSKMSFT2USD-USDT"},"responseBody":{"code":0,"msg":"","data":[{"symbol":"NCSKMSFT2USD-USDT","contractType":"nonCryptoStock","marketStatus":"open","timeZone":"UTC+08:00","updateTime":1792045615000,"sessions":[{"startTime":1793548800000,"endTime":1794153600000,"type":"REGULAR"}]}]},"request":{"info":["<div>本接口為公開行情接口，無需 API Key、timestamp、recvWindow 或 signature，參數透過 URL query string 傳遞。目前僅提供 PROD 環境。</div>","<div>僅支持 Open API 已開放且處於已上線或暫停狀態的非數幣合約（TradFi）。不傳 symbol 時返回全部符合條件的合約；尚未上線、已下線及數字貨幣合約不在查詢範圍內。指定不支持的合約時返回 109419。</div>","<div>固定返回 UTC+08:00 當天 00:00 起的 7 個完整自然日，並非從請求時刻起算 168 小時。不支持自訂時間範圍；攜帶 startTime 或 endTime（包括空值或 0）會返回 109400。</div>"],"info_en":["<div>This is a public market data endpoint. No API Key, timestamp, recvWindow or signature is required. Pass parameters in the URL query string. Currently available in PROD only.</div>","<div>Only online or paused non-crypto (TradFi) contracts supported by Open API are included. Omit symbol to return all eligible contracts. Pre-listing, delisted and cryptocurrency contracts are excluded. Specifying an unsupported contract returns 109419.</div>","<div>The fixed window covers 7 complete calendar days starting at 00:00 today in UTC+08:00, not 168 hours from the request time. Custom time ranges are not supported. Sending startTime or endTime, including an empty value or 0, returns 109400.</div>"],"list":[{"name":"symbol","type":"string","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"非數幣合約交易對，例如 NCSKMSFT2USD-USDT；不傳時查詢全部符合條件的合約","en":"Non-crypto contract symbol, for example NCSKMSFT2USD-USDT. Omit to query all eligible contracts"}]},"response":{"info":["<div>data 為合約列表，即使指定單一 symbol 也以數組返回。sessions 為計畫交易／休市時段，按時間排序，相鄰同類型時段可能合併，並非每天固定返回一條。</div>","<div>時段採用左閉右開區間 [startTime, endTime)。所有時間戳均為 Unix 毫秒時間戳；timeZone 僅表示交易日曆使用的固定時區。</div>","<div>sessions[].type=REGULAR 不保證當下可交易，仍須結合 marketStatus 及其他交易限制判斷。已上線合約處於 Rebase 停盤、預開盤或恢復階段時，marketStatus 為 close；這與尚未上線的合約不支持查詢是不同情況。</div>","<div>響應示例僅展示數據結構；實際狀態和時段以查詢結果為準。</div>"],"info_en":["<div>data is a list of contracts, including when a single symbol is specified. sessions contains scheduled trading and non-trading intervals in chronological order. Adjacent intervals of the same type may be merged; there is not necessarily one entry per day.</div>","<div>Each interval is half-open: [startTime, endTime), including the start and excluding the end. All timestamps are Unix milliseconds. timeZone identifies the fixed time zone used for the trading calendar.</div>","<div>sessions[].type=REGULAR does not guarantee that trading is currently available; also check marketStatus and other trading restrictions. An online contract in a Rebase halt, pre-open or recovery phase has marketStatus=close. This differs from a pre-listing contract, which is not supported by this endpoint.</div>","<div>The response example illustrates the data structure. Refer to the actual response for current status and scheduled intervals.</div>"],"list":[{"name":"data","type":"array","values":"","zh":"符合查詢條件的非數幣合約交易時段列表","en":"Trading schedules for eligible non-crypto contracts"},{"name":"data[].symbol","type":"string","values":"","zh":"合約交易對，例如 NCSKMSFT2USD-USDT","en":"Contract symbol, for example NCSKMSFT2USD-USDT"},{"name":"data[].contractType","type":"string","values":"nonCryptoForex / nonCryptoCommodity / nonCryptoStock / nonCryptoStockIndex","zh":"非數幣合約類型：nonCryptoForex 外匯；nonCryptoCommodity 商品；nonCryptoStock 股票；nonCryptoStockIndex 股票指數","en":"Non-crypto contract type: nonCryptoForex = forex; nonCryptoCommodity = commodity; nonCryptoStock = stock; nonCryptoStockIndex = stock index"},{"name":"data[].marketStatus","type":"string","values":"open / close / pause","zh":"當前市場狀態：open 開市；close 休市；pause 暫停交易","en":"Current market status: open = market open; close = market closed; pause = trading paused"},{"name":"data[].timeZone","type":"string","values":"UTC+08:00","zh":"交易日曆時區，固定為 UTC+08:00（東八區）","en":"Trading calendar time zone, fixed at UTC+08:00"},{"name":"data[].updateTime","type":"int64","values":"","zh":"合約配置更新時間，Unix 毫秒時間戳；不是本次查詢時間，無可用更新時間時為 0","en":"Contract configuration update time in Unix milliseconds, not the current request time. Returns 0 when no update time is available"},{"name":"data[].sessions","type":"array","values":"","zh":"7 個完整自然日內的計畫交易及休市時段","en":"Scheduled trading and non-trading intervals over the 7 complete calendar days"},{"name":"data[].sessions[].startTime","type":"int64","values":"","zh":"時段開始時間，Unix 毫秒時間戳，包含此時刻","en":"Interval start time in Unix milliseconds, inclusive"},{"name":"data[].sessions[].endTime","type":"int64","values":"","zh":"時段結束時間，Unix 毫秒時間戳，不包含此時刻","en":"Interval end time in Unix milliseconds, exclusive"},{"name":"data[].sessions[].type","type":"string","values":"REGULAR / NO_TRADING","zh":"計畫時段類型：REGULAR 計畫交易時段；NO_TRADING 計畫休市時段","en":"Scheduled interval type: REGULAR = scheduled trading; NO_TRADING = scheduled non-trading"}]},"error":{"info":"109400：移除 startTime/endTime，使用接口固定的 7 天窗口。109419：確認合約為 Open API 支持且已上線或暫停的非數幣合約。","info_en":"109400: Remove startTime/endTime and use the fixed 7-day window. 109419: Check that the symbol is an online or paused non-crypto contract supported by Open API.","list":[{"code":"109400","msg":"startTime and endTime are not supported; trading schedule covers 7 calendar days from today (UTC+08:00)"},{"code":"109419","msg":"trading schedules are only available for online or paused non-crypto symbols supported in open api"}]}},"info":{"en":[{"type":"div","info":"Signature Verification: No"},{"type":"div","info":"Endpoint description: Query scheduled trading intervals and current market status for non-crypto (TradFi) perpetual contracts."}],"zh":[{"type":"div","info":"是否驗簽: 否"},{"type":"div","info":"接口描述：查詢非數幣（TradFi）永續合約的計畫交易時段及當前市場狀態。"}]}}


