理財","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-06-17","path":"/openApi/wealth/v1/product/dual-currency/position","type":"新增","info":"新增雙幣倉位查詢接口，查詢當前持有的雙幣理財倉位。","model":"理財","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-06-17","path":"/openApi/wealth/v1/product/dual-currency/order-records","type":"新增","info":"新增雙幣訂單記錄查詢接口，支持分頁查詢歷史雙幣理財訂單。","model":"理財","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-05-28","path":"/openApi/copyTrading/v1/swap/trace/currentTrack","type":"下線","info":"下線接口：交易員當前帶單。","model":"跟單","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-05-28","path":"/openApi/copyTrading/v1/swap/trace/closeTrackOrder","type":"下線","info":"下線接口：交易員按帶單訂單號平倉。","model":"跟單","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-03-19","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/quote/premiumIndex","type":"更新","info":"最新標記價格和資金費率接口響應新增字段：fundingIntervalHours、minFundingRate、maxFundingRate、updateTime，並補充字段描述（fundingIntervalHours 枚舉值 1/2/4/8；minFundingRate、maxFundingRate 以小數表示百分比；updateTime 為 Unix 毫秒時間戳）。","model":"U本位永續合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-02-25","path":"/openApi/spot/v2/market/kline","type":"更新","info":"K線數據接口新增入參 timeZone，僅支持 0 或 8（UTC+0/UTC+8）。","model":"現貨交易","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-02-25","path":"/openApi/swap/v3/quote/klines","type":"更新","info":"K線數據接口新增入參 timeZone，僅支持 0 或 8（UTC+0/UTC+8）。","model":"U本位永續合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-02-25","path":"/openApi/cswap/v1/market/klines","type":"更新","info":"K線數據接口新增入參 timeZone，僅支持 0 或 8（UTC+0/UTC+8）。","model":"幣本位永續合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-01-22","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts","type":"更新","info":"OpenAPI 現已支援 TradFi（非數位資產）交易對。帶有 TradFi 或非數位資產關鍵字的交易對，可透過 /openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts 介面取得。","model":"U本位永續合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-01-05","path":"","type":"更新","info":"行情相關 API 的限頻規則已調整為統一標準。所有行情接口的請求頻率限制為：每 10 秒最多 500 次請求。","model":"行情數據","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-01-05","path":"/openApi/account/transfer/v1/subAccount/transferAsset","type":"更新","info":"fromAccountType 與 toAccountType 新增類型值：15（現貨帳戶）。目前支援的帳戶類型包含：1－資金帳戶；2－標準合約帳戶；3－永續 U 本位合約帳戶；15－現貨帳戶。","model":"賬戶與錢包",