":"修復","info":"修復了TP單撤單接口和查詢訂單接口中，clientOrderId 為空的問題","model":"合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-08-21","path":"U本位永續合約","type":"新增","info":"查詢當前全部掛單接口響應增加positionId字段","model":"合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-08-21","path":"U本位永續合約","type":"新增","info":"API和Websocket不支持外匯","model":"合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-07-11","path":"賬戶與錢包","type":"新增","info":"查詢幣種充提數據入參和響應增加displayName字段。","model":"錢包 & 賬戶","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-07-11","path":"賬戶與錢包","type":"新增","info":"提幣記錄、充值記錄和查詢子賬號充值記錄的入參增加txId字段。","model":"錢包 & 賬戶","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-07-11","path":"賬戶與錢包","type":"新增","info":"主賬戶充值地址、創建子帳戶充值地址和查詢子賬戶充值地址的響應增加wallType字段。","model":"錢包 & 賬戶","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-07-09","path":"U本位永續合約","type":"移除","info":"‘賬戶餘額和倉位更新推送’移除SNAPSHOT類型。","model":"合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-06-30","path":"現貨","type":"新增","info":"‘現貨交易對’增加displayName字段。","model":"現貨","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-06-30","path":"幣本位永續合約","type":"新增","info":"‘查詢合約基礎信息’增加displayName字段。","model":"合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-06-30","path":"U本位永續合約","type":"新增","info":"‘合約交易幣對’增加displayName字段。","model":"合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-06-17","path":"U本位永續合約","type":"調整","info":"Websocket“有限深度檔位”推播間隔調整為200ms或500ms。","model":"合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-06-12","path":"永續U本位","type":"新增","info":"查詢單個訂單詳情和查詢所有委託中訂單的返回增加closePosition字段。","model":"合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-06-12","path":"永續U本位","type":"新增","info":"下單接口的返回增加executedQty字段。","model":"合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-05-14","path":"公共","type":"新增","info":"新增調查問卷","model":"公共","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-04-25","path":"錢包&賬戶","type":"新增","info":"提幣接口新增‘現貨賬戶’類型","model":"錢包 & 賬戶","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-04-25","path":"現貨","type":"新增","info":"balance接口新增displayName字段","model":"現貨","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-04-25","path":"永續幣本位","type":"新增","info":"下單、撤單和查單支持clientOrderId","model":"合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-03-13","path":"永續U本位","type":"新增","info":"新增‘逐倉分倉’持倉模式","model":"合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-02-10","path":"永續U本位","type":"新增","info":"‘查詢當前全部掛單’接口增加actPrice字段。","model":"合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-01-22","path":"永續U本位","type":"新增","info":"所有下單相關接口增加Status字段","model":"合約","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-01-21","path":"永續U本位","type":"新增","info":"查詢所有掛單接口增加Price字段和PriceRate字段描述","model":"合約","link":""}],"en":[{"updateTime":"2026-11-02","path":"/openApi/swap/v1/quote/tradingSchedule","type":"New","info":"Added the trading schedule endpoint for non-crypto (TradFi) perpetual contracts. No API Key or signature is required. The IP rate limit is 500 requests per 10 seconds; currently available in PROD only. Query a symbol or all eligible contracts for scheduled intervals over 7 complete calendar days from 00:00 today in UTC+08:00, together with current market status.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Futures","link":"#/en/Swap/Market%20Data/Trading%20Schedule"},{"updateTime":"2026-11-02","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/trade/order","type":"Update","info":"Clarified One-way Mode reduce-only orders: when a contract is restricted from opening positions (status=25), closing orders with positionSide=BOTH and reduceOnly=true are not rejected with 109415 solely because of that status. Opening orders remain restricted. Other trading validations still apply, and execution is not guaranteed.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Futures","link":"#/en/Swap/Trades%20Endpoints/Place%20order"},{"updateTime":"2026-11-02","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/trade/fillHistory","type":"Update","info":"Corrected fill history pagination documentation: removed the unsupported lastFillId parameter and updated request and code examples to use pageIndex and pageSize. Sending lastFillId, including an empty value or 0, returns 100400. Keep the time range and filters unchanged when requesting subsequent pages.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Futures","link":"#/en/Swap/Trades%20Endpoints/Query%20historical%20transaction%20details"},{"updateTime":"2026-10-30","path":"WebSocket {symbol}@incrDepth","type":"Update","info":"Corrected incremental depth documentation: removed the consecutive lastUpdateId +1 requirement and fixed three-message recovery guidance; clarified full snapshot initialization, replacing price-level quantities in reception order, and data.time as the server message construction time. An action=all received after unsubscribing does not establish recovery. Prefer a new connection and subscription, rebuilding only after a full snapshot is actually received on that connection; snapshot delivery is not guaranteed. The current protocol still cannot reliably detect missing messages using lastUpdateId alone, and increasing IDs alone do not prove completeness.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Futures","link":"#/en/Swap/Websocket%20Market%20Data/Incremental%20Depth%20Information"},{"updateTime":"2026-10-21","path":"/openApi/account/v1/uid","type":"Update","info":"Documented the accountStatus response field and its enum values: 0 = Normal, 1 = Deregistered, 2 = Locked. Updated the response example.","model":"Sub-account Management","link":"#/en/Account%20and%20Wallet/Sub-account%20Management/%20Query%20Account%20UID"},{"updateTime":"2026-10-21","path":"/openApi/activity/v1/getPublicActivityList","type":"New","info":"Added the public activity list endpoint. No API Key, signature, or timestamp is required. The IP rate limit is 100 requests per 10 seconds. Supports activity status, activity type, partial title matching, and pagination.","model":"Activity","link":"#/en/Activity/Query%20Public%20Activity%20List"},{"updateTime":"2026-10-20","path":"/openApi/activity/v1/getActivityList","type":"New","info":"Added a private activity list endpoint requiring API Key authentication and signature verification, limited to 100 requests per 10 seconds per IP. Supports status (1: starting soon; 2: ongoing, the default), activity type filtering with tagUrlKey, partial title matching with activityName, and pagination. Returns eight activity card fields.","model":"Activity","link":"#/en/Activity/Query%20Activity%20List"},{"updateTime":"2026-10-20","path":"/openApi/agent/v1/reward/channelCommissionList","type":"New","info":"Added the channel commission details endpoint with pagination and optional subordinate UID, business type, and asset type filters. The rate limit is 10 requests per second per UID. Out-of-range pages retain the actual total number of matching records.","model":"Agent","link":"#/en/Agent/Channel%20Commission%20Details"},{"updateTime":"2026-10-20","path":"/openApi/social/v1/swap/signal","type":"Added","info":"Added the optional orderType parameter to Create Signal. It applies only to take-profit and stop-loss orders: LIMIT for limit orders (default) or MARKET for market orders. Updated the request and code examples.","model":"Signal","link":"#/en/Signal/Signal/Create%20Signal"},{"updateTime":"2026-10-20","path":"WebSocket {symbol}@trade","type":"Added","info":"Added the t field to each item in the latest trade data array. It contains the matching trade ID and is returned as a string to avoid precision loss for large integers.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/Swap/Websocket%20Market%20Data/Subscribe%20the%20Latest%20Trade%20Detail"},{"updateTime":"2026-10-20","path":"Public market data APIs","type":"Update","info":"Removed API Key permission requirements from the Chinese and English public Spot, USDT-M, and Coin-M market data documentation. All public market code examples now omit API Keys and signatures, and timestamp requirements reflect verified behavior. USDT-M Trading Rules, USDT-M Query historical transaction orders, and Coin-M Contract Information still require timestamp; their examples generate the current timestamp dynamically.","model":"Market Data","link":"#/en/Swap/Market%20Data/Recent%20Trades%20List"},{"updateTime":"2026-10-09","path":"WebSocket TRADE_UPDATE","type":"Added","info":"Added the li field to Order Update Push. It returns the parent order ID associated with a take-profit or stop-loss order and is included only when a related parent order exists.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/Swap/Websocket%20Account%20Data/Order%20update%20push"},{"updateTime":"2026-09-05","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/user/positions","type":"Update","info":"Improved error handling for Query Position Data. When the position query service is temporarily unavailable, the API returns business error code 109500 (The current system is busy, please try again later) instead of code=0 with data=[]. code=0 with data=[] indicates a successful query with no matching positions.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/Swap/Account%20Endpoints/Query%20position%20data"},{"updateTime":"2026-08-31","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/quote/fundingRate","type":"Update","info":"Clarified that Get Funding Rate History returns completed historical funding settlement records only. It does not provide the current or estimated rate for the next settlement or return nextFundingTime; also refined the fundingRate and fundingTime field descriptions.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/Swap/Market%20Data/Get%20Funding%20Rate%20History"},{"updateTime":"2026-08-28","path":"/openApi/wealth/v1/product/dual-currency/order","type":"Update","info":"Corrected the API Key permission for Dual-Currency Place Order to Spot Trading; marked sku, productId, strikePrice, and quoteId as required, and added the quote parameter source and request example.","model":"Wealth","link":"#/en/Wealth/Dual-Currency/Dual-Currency%20Place%20Order"},{"updateTime":"2026-08-26","path":"Coin-M API Request URLs","type":"Update","info":"Removed the VST environment from the Coin-M REST and WebSocket documentation. Coin-M APIs currently support the PROD environment only.","model":"Coin-M Perp Futures","link":"#/en/Coin-M%20Futures/Trades%20Endpoints/Trade%20order"},{"updateTime":"2026-08-24","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/trade/order","type":"Update","info":"Clarified the closePosition, quantity, reduceOnly, and positionId requirements for Place order: quantity and stopPrice remain mandatory when closePosition=true; reduceOnly must not be sent in Hedge Mode; positionId is not required in regular Hedge Mode.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/Swap/Trades%20Endpoints/Place%20order"},{"updateTime":"2026-08-24","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/trade/order/test","type":"Update","info":"Clarified the closePosition, quantity, reduceOnly, and positionId requirements for Test Order to match the Place order parameter rules.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/Swap/Trades%20Endpoints/Test%20Order"},{"updateTime":"2026-08-21","path":"Signature Authentication","type":"Update","info":"Added application/x-www-form-urlencoded body signing rules. Signatures must be calculated from the final URL-encoded parameter string that is actually transmitted, with a stopLoss signing example.","model":"API","link":"#/en/Quick%20Start/Signature%20Authentication"},{"updateTime":"2026-08-10","path":"/openApi/cswap/v2/trade/order","type":"Update","info":"Coin-M Trade Order is upgraded to the v2 path. positionSide is required, and order fields are returned under data.order.","model":"Coin-M Perp Futures","link":"#/en/CSwap/Trades%20Endpoints/Trade%20order"},{"updateTime":"2026-08-07","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/trade/positionHistory","type":"Update","info":"Updated Query Position History to the v2 path. Request time fields are startTime and endTime, the response uses realizedProfit, and USDC contract symbols such as BTC-USDC are supported.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/Swap/Trades%20Endpoints/Query%20Position%20History"},{"updateTime":"2026-08-07","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/trade/allFillOrders","type":"Update","info":"Query historical transaction orders now supports currency=USDC and USDC contract symbols such as BTC-USDC. The response currency field may be USDT or USDC.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/Swap/Trades%20Endpoints/Query%20historical%20transaction%20orders"},{"updateTime":"2026-08-07","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/trade/allOrders","type":"Update","info":"Query Order history now supports currency=USDC and USDC contract symbols such as BTC-USDC. The maximum query range is 7 days.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/Swap/Trades%20Endpoints/Query%20Order%20history"},{"updateTime":"2026-08-07","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/trade/fillHistory","type":"Update","info":"Query historical transaction details now supports currency=USDC and USDC contract symbols such as BTC-USDC. The commissionAsset response field may be USDT or USDC.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/Swap/Trades%20Endpoints/Query%20historical%20transaction%20details"},{"updateTime":"2026-08-07","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/user/positions","type":"Update","info":"Query position data now supports the currency parameter to filter positions by USDT or USDC settlement currency. If currency is omitted, positions for all settlement currencies are returned.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/Swap/Account%20Endpoints/Query%20position%20data"},{"updateTime":"2026-08-07","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/user/income","type":"Update","info":"Get Account Profit and Loss Fund Flow now supports the currency parameter for USDT or USDC settlement currencies. If currency is omitted, the default is USDT.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/Swap/Account%20Endpoints/Get%20Account%20Profit%20and%20Loss%20Fund%20Flow"},{"updateTime":"2026-08-05","path":"/openApi/swap/v1/trade/positionHistory","type":"Update","info":"Updated the pageIndex documentation for Query Position History: pagination starts from 0, and omitted pageIndex defaults to 0.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/Swap/Trades%20Endpoints/Query%20Position%20History"},{"updateTime":"2026-07-29","path":"/openApi/spot/v2/quote/trades","type":"Update","info":"Upgraded Recent Trades List to the v2 quote path and removed the unnecessary timestamp and recvWindow request parameters.","model":"Spot","link":"#/en/Spot/Market%20Data/Recent%20Trades%20List"},{"updateTime":"2026-07-29","path":"/openApi/spot/v2/quote/klines","type":"Update","info":"Upgraded Kline/Candlestick Data to the v2 quote path and documented the order of all eight array fields.","model":"Spot","link":"#/en/Spot/Market%20Data/Kline%2FCandlestick%20Data"},{"updateTime":"2026-07-29","path":"/openApi/spot/v2/quote/ticker","type":"Update","info":"Upgraded 24hr Ticker Price Change Statistics to the v2 quote path and aligned priceChange, best bid/ask, and time fields with the actual response.","model":"Spot","link":"#/en/Spot/Market%20Data/24hr%20Ticker%20Price%20Change%20Statistics"},{"updateTime":"2026-07-29","path":"/openApi/spot/v2/quote/depth","type":"Update","info":"Upgraded Order Book aggregation to the v2 quote path, renamed the depth request parameter to limit, and marked type as required.","model":"Spot","link":"#/en/Spot/Market%20Data/Order%20Book%20aggregation"},{"updateTime":"2026-07-29","path":"/openApi/spot/v2/quote/price","type":"Update","info":"Upgraded Symbol Price Ticker to the v2 quote path, documented symbol as optional, and corrected data to an array response.","model":"Spot","link":"#/en/Spot/Market%20Data/Symbol%20Price%20Ticker"},{"updateTime":"2026-07-29","path":"/openApi/spot/v2/quote/bookTicker","type":"Update","info":"Upgraded Symbol Order Book Ticker to the v2 quote path, corrected the quantity fields to bidQty and askQty, and added the time field.","model":"Spot","link":"#/en/Spot/Market%20Data/Symbol%20Order%20Book%20Ticker"},{"updateTime":"2026-07-29","path":"/openApi/spot/v2/quote/historicalKlines","type":"Update","info":"Upgraded Historical K-line to the v2 quote path and documented the result limit and order of all eight array fields.","model":"Spot","link":"#/en/Spot/Market%20Data/Historical%20K-line"},{"updateTime":"2026-07-29","path":"/openApi/spot/v2/quote/historicalTrades","type":"Update","info":"Upgraded Historical Trades to the v2 quote path and aligned field definitions and data types with the actual response.","model":"Spot","link":"#/en/Spot/Market%20Data/Historical%20Trades"},{"updateTime":"2026-07-10","path":"/openApi/swap/v1/trade/positionHistory","type":"Update","info":"Query Position History now supports USDC contract symbols in the symbol parameter, such as BTC-USDC.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/Swap/Trades%20Endpoints/Query%20Position%20History"},{"updateTime":"2026-07-10","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/trade/order","type":"Update","info":"Place order now rejects offline symbols. If the specified symbol is offline, the request returns error code 109418.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/Swap/Trades%20Endpoints/Place%20order"},{"updateTime":"2026-07-02","path":"/openApi/agent/v2/reward/commissionDataList","type":"Update","info":"Added distanceType request parameter to Daily commission details (omit this parameter: query all; 1: direct invite; 2: indirect invite), and added tradFi to businessType. To query crypto perpetual futures data, subtract tradFi data from perpetualFutures data.","model":"Agent","link":"#/en/Agent/Agent/Daily%20commission%20details"},{"updateTime":"2026-07-02","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts","type":"Update","info":"Removed the offTime response field from the USDT-M Perp Futures symbols endpoint.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/Swap/Market%20Data/USDT-M%20Perp%20Futures%20symbols"},{"updateTime":"2026-07-01","path":"/openApi/spot/v1/oco/orderList","type":"Update","info":"Query OCO Order endpoint parameter changes: removed orderListId parameter (passing it will return an error); added orderId parameter. Either orderId or clientOrderId must be provided.","model":"Spot","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-06-17","path":"/openApi/wealth/v1/product/dual-currency/invest-asset-list","type":"Added","info":"Added Dual-Currency product list endpoint, supporting filtering by investment asset, exercise asset, direction, and duration.","model":"Wealth","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-06-17","path":"/openApi/wealth/v1/product/dual-currency/pre-order","type":"Added","info":"Added Dual-Currency pre-order quote endpoint for querying real-time quotes by SKU, strike price, and product ID.","model":"Wealth","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-06-17","path":"/openApi/wealth/v1/product/dual-currency/order","type":"Added","info":"Added Dual-Currency place order endpoint, supporting purchase with specified investment asset, amount, and settlement account.","model":"Wealth","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-06-17","path":"/openApi/wealth/v1/product/dual-currency/position","type":"Added","info":"Added Dual-Currency position query endpoint to retrieve current dual-currency holdings.","model":"Wealth","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-06-17","path":"/openApi/wealth/v1/product/dual-currency/order-records","type":"Added","info":"Added Dual-Currency order records endpoint with pagination support for querying historical dual-currency orders.","model":"Wealth","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-05-28","path":"/openApi/copyTrading/v1/swap/trace/currentTrack","type":"Offline","info":"Removed endpoint: Trader's current order.","model":"Copy Trade","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-05-28","path":"/openApi/copyTrading/v1/swap/trace/closeTrackOrder","type":"Offline","info":"Removed endpoint: Traders close positions according to the order number.","model":"Copy Trade","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-03-19","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/quote/premiumIndex","type":"Update","info":"Added response fields to Mark Price and Funding Rate endpoint: fundingIntervalHours, minFundingRate, maxFundingRate, and updateTime; also refined field descriptions (fundingIntervalHours enum: 1/2/4/8, minFundingRate and maxFundingRate are decimal percentages, updateTime is a Unix timestamp in milliseconds).","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-02-25","path":"/openApi/spot/v2/market/kline","type":"Update","info":"Added timeZone parameter to the Kline/Candlestick Data endpoint; only 0 or 8 supported (UTC+0/UTC+8).","model":"Spot Trading","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-02-25","path":"/openApi/swap/v3/quote/klines","type":"Update","info":"Added timeZone parameter to the Kline/Candlestick Data endpoint; only 0 or 8 supported (UTC+0/UTC+8).","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-02-25","path":"/openApi/cswap/v1/market/klines","type":"Update","info":"Added timeZone parameter to the Kline/Candlestick Data endpoint; only 0 or 8 supported (UTC+0/UTC+8).","model":"Coin-M Perp Futures","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-01-22","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts","type":"Update","info":"OpenAPI now supports TradFi (non-crypto) trading pairs. Trading pairs with TradFi or non-crypto identifiers can be retrieved via the /openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts endpoint.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-01-05","path":"","type":"Update","info":"The rate limit policy for Market Data APIs has been updated to a unified standard. All market-related endpoints are now limited to a maximum of 500 requests per 10 seconds.","model":"Market Data","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-01-05","path":"/openApi/account/transfer/v1/subAccount/transferAsset","type":"Update","info":"A new account type value (15: Spot Account) has been added to fromAccountType and toAccountType. The supported account types now include: 1 – Fund Account; 2 – Standard Futures Account; 3 – Perpetual USDT-M Account; 15 – Spot Account.","model":"Wallet & Account","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-01-05","path":"/openApi/spot/v1/common/symbols","type":"Update","info":"A new status value (29: Pre-Delisted) has been added to the symbol list API. When a symbol is in Pre-Delisted (29) or Delisted (30) status, order placement requests will be blocked by the API service, while order cancellation is still allowed.","model":"Spot Trading","link":""},{"updateTime":"2026-01-05","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/trade/order","type":"Update","info":"Added order-by-quote functionality with the field quoteOrderQty.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-12-18","path":"/openApi/swap/v2/trade/getVst","type":"Upgraded","info":"Upgraded the futures demo VST claim endpoint from v1 to v2, adding support for increasing or decreasing custom amounts.","model":"Swap Trading","link":"#/en/Swap/Trades%20Endpoints/Apply%20VST"},{"updateTime":"2025-12-16","path":"-","type":"Update","info":"Removed IP rate limits for Account API Group [2] and Group [3]. The previous IP-based limits, including the total group limit (2000 requests per 10 seconds) and the per-endpoint limit (300 requests per 10 seconds), are no longer applied.","model":"API","link":""},{"updateTime":"2025-12-09","path":"/openApi/account/transfer/v1/subAccount/transferAsset","type":"Added","info":"Added the Sub-Mother Account Asset Transfer interface. This interface is only available to the parent account and is used for asset transfers between the parent account and sub-accounts.","model":"Sub-account Management","link":"#/en/Account%20&%20Wallet/Sub-account%20Management/Sub-Mother%20Account%20Asset%20Transfer%20Interface%20(Only%20for%20Parent%20Account%20Operations)"},{"updateTime":"2025-12-09","path":"/openApi/wallets/v1/capital/innerTransfer/apply","type":"Update","info":"The main account internal transfer API now supports transferring spot assets.","model":"Fund Account","link":"#/en/account-and-wallet/Fund%20Account/Main%20Accoun%20internal%20transfer"},{"updateTime":"2025-12-09","path":"/openApi/wallets/v1/capital/subAccountInnerTransfer/apply","type":"Update","info":"The sub-account internal transfer API now supports transferring spot assets.","model":"Sub-account Management","link":"#/en/account-and-wallet/Sub-account%20management/%20Sub-account%20Internal%20Transfer"},{"updateTime":"2025-12-09","path":"/openApi/account/transfer/v1/subAccount/transferAsset/supportCoins","type":"Update","info":"The transferable asset query API now supports spot asset queries.","model":"Sub-account Management","link":"#/en/account-and-wallet/Fund%20Account/Query%20transferable%20currency"},{"updateTime":"2025-12-09","path":"/openApi/spot/v1/common/symbols","type":"Update","info":"Added a new field \"maxMarketNotional\" to the spot symbol list, indicating the maximum notional amount allowed for a single market order.","model":"Spot Trading","link":"#/en/spot/Market%20Data/Spot%20trading%20symbols"},{"updateTime":"2025-11-25","path":"/openApi/spot/v2/ticker/price","type":"Upgraded","info":"Upgraded the Spot ticker price endpoint from v1 to v2, adding support for querying latest prices for single or multiple symbols and refining response fields and rate limits to improve performance and data consistency.","model":"Spot Trading","link":"#/en/spot/Market%20Data/Symbol%20Price%20Ticker"},{"updateTime":"2025-11-13","path":"/openApi/swap/v1/trade/amend","type":"Added","info":"Added the Modify Order API, allowing users to update unfilled or partially filled perpetual futures orders.","model":"USDT-M Perpetual Contracts","link":"#/en/swap/Trades%20Endpoints/Modify%20Order"},{"updateTime":"2025-11-13","path":"/openApi/copyTrading/v1/PFutures/traderDetail","type":"Added","info":"Added PFutures personal trading overview API for traders to view their overall copy trading performance, including profit rate, account assets, copier profit, risk level, and other key metrics.","model":"Copy Trading","link":"#/en/copy-trade/USDT-M%20Perpetual%20Contracts/Personal%20Trading%20Overview"},{"updateTime":"2025-11-13","path":"/openApi/copyTrading/v1/PFutures/profitHistorySummarys","type":"Added","info":"Added PFutures copy trading profit overview API for querying estimated weekly earnings, cumulative settled profit, and profit sharing ratio.","model":"Copy Trading","link":"#/en/copy-trade/USDT-M%20Perpetual%20Contracts/Profit%20Overview"},{"updateTime":"2025-11-13","path":"/