module.exports = {"type":"REST","title":"查詢公開活動列表","en":"Query Public Activity List","api":{"uri":"/openApi/activity/v1/getPublicActivityList","method":"GET","rate-limitation":"","ip-rate-limit":"100/10s","payload":{"status":2,"tagUrlKey":"trading_tournament","pageIndex":1,"pageSize":10},"responseBody":{"code":0,"timestamp":1792425600000,"data":{"total":1,"activityCenterInfoVos":[{"activityId":12345,"activityUrl":"https://bingx.com/en/events/","title":"Trading Competition","tags":[{"name":"Trading"}],"beginTime":"2026-10-13T10:00:00.000+08:00","endTime":"2026-10-31T23:59:59.000+08:00","activityCenterPcImg":null,"activityCenterAppImg":null}]}},"request":{"info":["支持按活動狀態、活動類型和標題組合篩選。","status 默認為 2（進行中），傳入 1 查詢即將開始的活動；不支持其他狀態值。","activityName 和 tagUrlKey 會忽略首尾空格，不傳或空白表示不按對應條件篩選。tagUrlKey 使用活動類型標籤的 urlKey，而非標籤展示名稱。"],"info_en":["Activity status, type, and title filters can be combined.","status defaults to 2 (ongoing). Use 1 to query activities that are starting soon. Other status values are not supported.","Leading and trailing spaces in activityName and tagUrlKey are ignored. Omit either parameter or use whitespace to disable that filter. tagUrlKey is the activity type tag urlKey, not its display name."],"list":[{"name":"activityName","type":"string","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"活動標題模糊搜尋關鍵字；忽略首尾空格，不傳或空白表示不篩選","en":"Keyword for partial matching on activity titles. Leading and trailing spaces are ignored. Omit or use whitespace to disable filtering."},{"name":"status","type":"int","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"1, 2","zh":"活動狀態：1 即將開始、2 進行中；默認為 2，僅支持 1 或 2","en":"Activity status: 1 for starting soon or 2 for ongoing. Defaults to 2. Only 1 and 2 are supported."},{"name":"tagUrlKey","type":"string","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"活動類型標籤的 urlKey，例如 highReward（高價值）、spot（現貨）、trading_tournament（交易賽）、draw（抽獎）；標籤由活動中心配置，並非固定枚舉。忽略首尾空格，不傳或空白表示全部類型","en":"Activity type tag urlKey, for example highReward (high-value), spot (spot trading), trading_tournament (trading competition), or draw (prize draw). Tags are configured in the activity center and are not a fixed enum. Leading and trailing spaces are ignored. Omit or use whitespace to query all types."},{"name":"pageIndex","type":"int","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"頁碼，從 1 開始，默認 1","en":"Page number, starting from 1. Defaults to 1."},{"name":"pageSize","type":"int","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"每頁條數，範圍為 1–100，默認 10","en":"Number of activities per page, from 1 to 100. Defaults to 10."}]},"response":{"info":["total 為符合篩選條件的活動總數，不是當前頁條數；無匹配或頁碼超出範圍時，activityCenterInfoVos 返回空數組。","每個活動固定返回 8 個字段。缺失的標量字段返回 null；tags 僅包含 name，無標籤時返回空數組。beginTime 和 endTime 為帶 +08:00 時區的 ISO 8601 字串。"],"info_en":["total is the total number of matching activities, not the number on the current page. activityCenterInfoVos is empty when no activities match or the page is out of range.","Each activity always contains eight fields. Missing scalar values are null. tags contains only name and is empty when no tags are available. beginTime and endTime are ISO 8601 strings with the +08:00 time zone offset."],"list":[{"name":"total","type":"int","values":"","zh":"符合篩選條件的活動總數","en":"Total number of matching activities."},{"name":"activityCenterInfoVos","type":"array","values":"","zh":"當前頁活動列表，元素字段如下","en":"Activities on the current page. Item fields are listed below."},{"name":"activityCenterInfoVos[].activityId","type":"long","values":"","zh":"活動 ID，缺失時為 null","en":"Activity ID, or null when unavailable."},{"name":"activityCenterInfoVos[].activityUrl","type":"string","values":"","zh":"活動鏈接，缺失時為 null","en":"Activity URL, or null when unavailable."},{"name":"activityCenterInfoVos[].title","type":"string","values":"","zh":"活動標題，缺失時為 null","en":"Activity title, or null when unavailable."},{"name":"activityCenterInfoVos[].tags","type":"array","values":"","zh":"活動展示標籤，無標籤時為空數組；每個標籤僅包含 name","en":"Display tags, or an empty array when no tags are available. Each tag contains only name."},{"name":"activityCenterInfoVos[].tags[].name","type":"string","values":"","zh":"標籤展示名稱","en":"Tag display name."},{"name":"activityCenterInfoVos[].beginTime","type":"string","values":"","zh":"活動開始時間，ISO 8601 格式，時區為 +08:00；缺失時為 null","en":"Activity start time in ISO 8601 format with the +08:00 offset, or null when unavailable."},{"name":"activityCenterInfoVos[].endTime","type":"string","values":"","zh":"活動結束時間，ISO 8601 格式，時區為 +08:00；缺失時為 null","en":"Activity end time in ISO 8601 format with the +08:00 offset, or null when unavailable."},{"name":"activityCenterInfoVos[].activityCenterPcImg","type":"string","values":"","zh":"活動中心 PC 圖片鏈接，缺失時為 null","en":"Activity center desktop image URL, or null when unavailable."},{"name":"activityCenterInfoVos[].activityCenterAppImg","type":"string","values":"","zh":"活動中心 App 圖片鏈接，缺失時為 null","en":"Activity center app image URL, or null when unavailable."}]},"error":{"info":"","info_en":"","list":[]},"requiresAuth":false},"info":{"en":[{"type":"div","info":"Signature Verification: No"},{"type":"div","info":"Endpoint description: Queries public activities with pagination, ongoing or starting-soon status, activity type, and partial title filters."},{"type":"div","info":"Error Codes: See <a href=\"#/en/Quick%20Start/Error%20Code%20Reference?anchor=cat-gateway\" style=\"color:#409eff;\">Error Code Reference — General Error Codes</a>"}],"zh":[{"type":"div","info":"是否驗簽: 否"},{"type":"div","info":"接口描述：分頁查詢公開活動，支持進行中／即將開始狀態、活動類型及標題模糊篩選。"},{"type":"div","info":"錯誤碼：請參考 <a href=\"#/zh-tw/Quick%20Start/Error%20Code%20Reference?anchor=cat-gateway\" style=\"color:#409eff;\">錯誤碼參考 — 通用錯誤碼</a>"}]}}


