module.exports = {"type":"REST","title":"查詢歷史成交明細","en":"Query historical transaction details","api":{"uri":"/openApi/swap/v2/trade/fillHistory","method":"GET","rate-limitation":"5/second","ip-rate-limitation":"2","payload":{"endTs":"1786108422606","startTs":"1785503622606","symbol":"BTC-USDC","currency":"USDC","pageIndex":1,"pageSize":50},"responseBody":{"code":0,"msg":"","data":{"fill_history_orders":[{"symbol":"BTC-USDC","qty":"0.0001","quoteQty":"7.5586","role":"taker","commission":"-0.003779","commissionAsset":"USDC","price":"75586.05","orderId":"2085388523196895233","tradeId":"1110873278","filledTime":"2026-08-06T23:32:23.000+08:00","clientOrderID":"","realisedPNL":"0.00000000","side":"BUY","positionSide":"LONG"}],"total":17}},"request":{"info":["<div>訂單列表規則說明</div>","<div>排序：ORDER BY filledTime ASC, 以filledTime字段升序</div>","<div>使用 pageIndex 和 pageSize 分頁，pageIndex 從 1 開始。查詢後續頁時，保持時間範圍及其他篩選條件不變，逐頁遞增 pageIndex。</div>","<div>本接口不支持 lastFillId。請勿傳入此參數，包括空值或 0；只要攜帶該參數即返回錯誤碼 100400。請移除 lastFillId，改用 pageIndex 和 pageSize。</div>","<div>不傳 currency 時默認查詢 USDT；查詢 USDC 成交明細時，請使用 BTC-USDC 等 USDC 交易對，並建議同時傳入 currency=USDC。</div>","<div>最多能返回[從當前日期]到過去7天&最多能返回1000條歷史成交訂單，startTs = [當前日期] - 7days</div>","<div>如果startTs和endTs都填寫，則返回數據範圍:startTs < orderList <= endTs</div>","<div>如果只填寫endTs，則返回數據範圍:([當前日期] -7days) < orderList <= endTs</div>","<div>如果只填寫startTs不返回數據</div>","<div>如果填寫orderId，只返回該orderId的成交訂單明細</div>"],"info_en":["<div>Explanation of Order List Retrieval Rules</div>","<div>Sorting: ORDER BY filledTime ASC, in ascending order of filledTime field</div>","<div>Use pageIndex and pageSize for pagination, starting with pageIndex=1. For subsequent pages, keep the time range and other filters unchanged and increment pageIndex.</div>","<div>This endpoint does not support lastFillId. Do not send this parameter, even with an empty value or 0; its presence returns error code 100400. Remove lastFillId and use pageIndex and pageSize instead.</div>","<div>If currency is omitted