module.exports = {"type":"WEBSOCKET","title":"有限檔深度信息","en":"Partial Order Book Depth","info":{"en":[{"type":"div","info":"Push limited order book depth information."},{"type":"div","info":"Subscription Type: The dataType is <symbol>@depth<level>@<interval>, for example, BTC-USDT@depth20@200ms, SOL-USDT@depth100@500ms."},{"type":"div","info":"The push interval for BTC-USDT and ETH-USDT is 200ms, and for other contracts it is 500ms."}],"zh":[{"type":"div","info":"推送有限檔深度信息"},{"type":"div","info":"訂閱類型：dataType 為 <symbol>@depth<level>@<interval>，比如BTC-USDT@depth20@200ms, SOL-USDT@depth100@500ms."},{"type":"div","info":"BTC-USDT和ETH-USDT推送間隔為200ms，其他幣對為500ms."}]},"api":{"topic":{},"jsoncMode":"path","payload":{"id":"e745cd6d-d0f6-4a70-8d5a-043e4c741b40","reqType":"sub","dataType":"BTC-USDT@depth5@500ms"},"unsub_payload":{"id":"24dd0e35-56a4-4f7a-af8a-394c7060909c","reqType":"unsub","dataType":"BTC-USDT@depth5@500ms"},"responseBody":{"id":"e745cd6d-d0f6-4a70-8d5a-043e4c741b40","code":0,"msg":"","dataType":"","data":null},"dataUpdateDemo":{"code":0,"dataType":"BTC-USDT@depth5@500ms","ts":1759996742928,"data":{"bids":[["121825.7","7.7622"],["121825.6","0.0060"],["121825.4","0.1234"],["121825.2","0.0021"],["121825.0","0.0023"]],"asks":[["121827.3","0.0025"],["121827.1","0.0010"],["121826.5","0.0028"],["121826.1","0.0143"],["121825.9","9.2345"]]}},"request":{"info":"","en":"","list":[{"name":"id","type":"string","required":"true","values":"","zh":"訂閱ID","en":"subscribe id"},{"name":"reqType","type":"string","required":"false","values":"sub/unsub","zh":"請求類型","en":"subscribe type"},{"name":"dataType","type":"string","required":"false","values":"BTC-USDT@depth5@500ms","zh":"數據類型","en":"data type"}]},"response":{"info":"有限檔深度消息使用頂層 ts，data 中不包含 T。ts 在每條消息構造時設定，後續快取、排隊及傳輸不會刷新；即使盤口內容未變，新構造的消息仍會重新取得伺服器時間。當客戶端與伺服器時鐘同步時，「客戶端接收時間 − ts」僅反映消息構造至接收的時間差，無法衡量構造前的上游行情延遲或源盤口資料的年齡。此消息沒有獨立的實際發布或網路傳輸時間字段。","en":"Limited depth messages use a top-level ts; data does not contain T. ts is assigned once per message during construction and is not refreshed during subsequent buffering, queuing, or transmission. Newly constructed messages receive a new server timestamp even if the order book contents have not changed. With synchronized client and server clocks, client receive time minus ts reflects only the time from message construction to reception, not upstream market-data delay before construction or the age of the source order book data. There is no separate field for the actual publication or network transmission time.","list":[{"name":"code","type":"int64","zh":"錯誤碼，0為正常，1為有錯誤","en":"Error code. 0 indicates success, 1 indicates an error."},{"name":"dataType","type":"string","zh":"訂閱的深度頻道，例如 BTC-USDT@depth5@500ms。","en":"Subscribed depth channel, for example: BTC-USDT@depth5@500ms."},{"name":"ts","type":"int64","zh":"消息構造時的伺服器 Unix 時間戳，單位為毫秒。不是撮合引擎更新時間、源盤口生成時間或精確的網路傳輸時間。","en":"Server Unix epoch timestamp in milliseconds at message construction. This is not the matching engine update time, source order book generation time, or exact network transmission time."},{"name":"data","type":"object","zh":"深度資料對象，包含 bids 和 asks。","en":"Order book depth object containing bids and asks."},{"name":"data.bids","type":"string[][]","zh":"買盤檔位。每個元素為 [價格, 數量]，價格和數量均以字串表示。","en":"Bid levels. Each element is [price, quantity], with both values represented as strings."},{"name":"data.asks","type":"string[][]","zh":"賣盤檔位。每個元素為 [價格, 數量]，價格和數量均以字串表示。","en":"Ask levels. Each element is [price, quantity], with both values represented as strings."}]},"error":{"info":"","en":"","list":[],"info_en":""}}}


