module.exports = {"type":"DESCRIPTION","title":"錯誤碼參考","en":"Error Code Reference","lines":{"zh":["<div style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:22px;color:#303133;\">API 錯誤碼參考</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;color:#606266;font-size:14px;\">以下列出 BingX OpenAPI 可能返回的所有錯誤碼及其說明，按服務模塊分類。</p></div>","<div style=\"margin-bottom:24px;padding:14px 18px;background:#f5f7fa;border-radius:6px;\"><b style=\"font-size:13px;color:#303133;\">快速導航：</b><br><span style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 14px 8px 0;\"><a href=\"#cat-http\" style=\"color:#409eff;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;\">HTTP 錯誤碼</a> <span style=\"color:#c0c4cc;\">(8)</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 14px 8px 0;\"><a href=\"#cat-gateway\" style=\"color:#409eff;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;\">通用錯誤碼</a> <span style=\"color:#c0c4cc;\">(10)</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 14px 8px 0;\"><a href=\"#cat-futures\" style=\"color:#409eff;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;\">合約錯誤碼</a> <span style=\"color:#c0c4cc;\">(72)</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 14px 8px 0;\"><a href=\"#cat-spot\" style=\"color:#409eff;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;\">現貨錯誤碼</a> <span style=\"color:#c0c4cc;\">(11)</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 14px 8px 0;\"><a href=\"#cat-account\" style=\"color:#409eff;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;\">帳號 / 錢包 / 代理錯誤碼</a> <span style=\"color:#c0c4cc;\">(6)</span></span></div>","<div id=\"cat-http\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;color:#303133;border-bottom:2px solid #409eff;padding-bottom:6px;display:inline-block;\">HTTP 錯誤碼</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;color:#909399;font-size:13px;\">HTTP 層面的狀態碼，適用於所有接口。</p></div><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 32px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\"><thead><tr style=\"background:#f5f7fa;text-align:left;\"><th style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;width:100px;font-weight:600;\">錯誤碼</th><th style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-weight:600;\">說明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">400</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Bad Request — 請求格式無效。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">401</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Unauthorized — 無效的 API Key。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">403</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Forbidden — 請求無權限。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">404</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Not Found — 請求的資源不存在。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">418</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">收到 429 後繼續訪問，IP 已被封禁。請停止請求並等待解封。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">429</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Too Many Requests — 請求太頻繁，已被系統限流。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">500</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Internal Server Error — 服務器內部錯誤。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">504</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Gateway Timeout — 服務端未能獲取響應，需進一步確認。</td></tr></tbody></table>","<div id=\"cat-gateway\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;color:#303133;border-bottom:2px solid #409eff;padding-bottom:6px;display:inline-block;\">通用錯誤碼</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;color:#909399;font-size:13px;\">適用於所有接口，在請求到達後端服務前由網關層返回。涵蓋簽名校驗、API Key 驗證、IP 白名單、限流等。</p></div><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 32px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\"><thead><tr style=\"background:#f5f7fa;text-align:left;\"><th style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;width:100px;font-weight:600;\">錯誤碼</th><th style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-weight:600;\">說明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100001</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">請求簽名校驗失敗。請檢查簽名算法、參數排序及 API Secret 是否正確。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100004</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">API Key 未開通對應交易權限。請在 API Key 管理頁面開啟所需權限。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100400</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">請求路由錯誤。常見原因：<ul style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0;padding-left:18px;\"><li>接口地址不存在，請參照 API 文檔確認路徑</li><li>請求方法（GET/POST）不正確</li></ul></td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100404</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">請求的接口路徑不存在或請求方法不正確。請確認 URL 及方法。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100410</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">請求頻率過高，已觸發限流。請降低請求頻率，限流結束後重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100412</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">請求缺少簽名（signature）。請在請求中附帶正確的簽名參數。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100413</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">API Key 不正確或未傳遞。請確認：<ul style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0;padding-left:18px;\"><li>API Key 正確且未被刪除</li><li>HTTP Header 中通過 X-BX-APIKEY 傳遞了 API Key</li></ul></td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100419</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">請求 IP 不在 API Key 的白名單中。請至 API Key 管理頁面檢查 IP 白名單設置。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100421</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">timestamp 為空或與服務端時間偏差過大。請確認本地時鐘同步。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100500</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">系統繁忙，請稍後重試。</td></tr></tbody></table>","<div id=\"cat-futures\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;color:#303133;border-bottom:2px solid #409eff;padding-bottom:6px;display:inline-block;\">合約錯誤碼</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;color:#909399;font-size:13px;\">U 本位及幣本位永續合約相關的業務錯誤。</p></div><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 32px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\"><thead><tr style=\"background:#f5f7fa;text-align:left;\"><th style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;width:100px;font-weight:600;\">錯誤碼</th><th style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-weight:600;\">說明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101201</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">當前持倉規模過大，無法使用請求的槓桿倍數。請先減少持倉再調整槓桿。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101202</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">下單金額低於合約最低要求。請增加下單金額，可查詢合約信息獲取最小值。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101204</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">保證金不足，無法完成下單。請增加保證金、降低槓桿或減少下單數量。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101205</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">當前無可用持倉，無法平倉。請先查詢持倉確認存在持倉後再操作。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101206</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">帳戶可用餘額不足。請補充資金後重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101209</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">當前槓桿下倉位價值已達上限。請降低槓桿或減少下單金額。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101210</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">帳戶所在地區受限或帳戶狀態異常，無法進行交易。請確認帳戶狀態或聯繫客服。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101211</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">委託價格超出允許範圍（過高或過低）。請調整委託價格至允許範圍內。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101212</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">可用資產不足以完成當前下單。請減少下單金額或補充資產。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101214</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">資金費率結算中，暫時無法下單。通常持續數秒，請稍後重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101215</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Post Only（僅掛單）訂單因會立即成交而被取消。請調整委託價格或改用其他訂單類型。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101219</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">帳戶資產正在處理中，暫時不可用。請稍後重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101222</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">當前槓桿風險過高，已被限制下單。請降低槓桿後再試。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101253</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">保證金不足（包含可調整保證金不足），無法完成操作。請補充資金或降低下單金額。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101290</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Reduce Only 訂單只能減少持倉，不能增加。請確認訂單方向和數量不超過當前持倉量。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101400</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">下單參數校驗失敗，可能的原因：<ul style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0;padding-left:18px;\"><li>下單金額或數量低於最小限制</li><li>止盈/止損價格不符合方向要求</li><li>clientOrderID 重複</li><li>交易對暫停交易</li></ul></td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101412</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">帳戶信息已變更，請刷新後重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101413</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">當前為非交易時段，暫時無法下單。請在交易時段內重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101414</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">槓桿倍數超出限制。可能超過交易對最大槓桿、特定時段槓桿受限，或非加密貨幣合約不支援 OpenAPI 單向持倉模式。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101415</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">該交易對已暫停開倉或暫停交易。請關注官方公告獲取恢復時間。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101419</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">掛單數量已達上限。請先取消部分掛單後再下新單。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101429</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">該訂單超出當前倉位限額。請減少下單數量或查詢倉位限額。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101434</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">體驗金帳戶不允許同時持有多空倉位。請先平倉後再開反向倉位。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101460</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">多單委託價格應高於預估強平價。請調高委託價格或降低槓桿。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101461</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">空單委託價格應低於預估強平價。請調低委託價格或降低槓桿。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101479</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">該倉位不是逐倉模式，無法調整逐倉保證金。請先切換為逐倉模式。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101481</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">clientOrderID 已被使用，不能重複。請為每筆新訂單使用唯一的 clientOrderID。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101483</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">需完成高級身份認證（KYC）後方可使用該功能。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101484</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">帳戶所在地區受限，或需完成高級身份認證。請確認帳戶地區合規性或完成 KYC。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101485</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">平倉數量低於最小限制。請提高平倉數量至最小值以上。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">102201</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">訂單已取消，因成交可能導致帳戶資產為負。請補充保證金或減少下單數量。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">104103</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">存在持倉或掛單，無法切換持倉模式。請先平倉並撤銷所有掛單。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">104108</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">單向持倉模式不支持獨立逐倉保證金模式。請切換為雙向持倉模式。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">104414</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">帶單交易員不支援該功能。請使用非帶單帳戶進行操作。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">104424</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">當前為非交易時段，無法調整槓桿或配置。請在交易時段內重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109201</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">相同的訂單號在短時間內重複提交。請確保每次請求使用唯一的 clientOrderID。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109400</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">請求參數不合法。常見原因：<ul style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0;padding-left:18px;\"><li>symbol 格式錯誤（須以 -USDT 或 -USDC 結尾）</li><li>缺少必填參數（symbol / timestamp / side / type 等）</li><li>參數值超出允許範圍（如 limit、interval、positionSide 等）</li><li>timestamp 不合法或與服務端時間偏差過大</li><li>查詢時間範圍超過限制（如 7 天或 90 天）</li><li>持倉模式與參數不匹配（如單向模式下 PositionSide 須為 BOTH）</li></ul></td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109403</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">請求被風控系統攔截，可能是頻率過高或撤單率超限。請修正請求後在限制時間結束後重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109417</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">該交易對處於預上線狀態，尚未開放交易。請查詢合約列表確認開放時間。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109418</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">交易對已下線，無法通過 OpenAPI 下單。請通過 /openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts 查詢交易對狀態。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109420</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">當前交易對下不存在對應持倉。請先查詢持倉信息。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109421</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">指定的訂單不存在，可能已成交、已撤銷或訂單 ID 錯誤。請先查詢訂單狀態確認。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109425</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">請求的交易對不存在或不支援。請調用 /openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts 確認交易對是否有效。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109429</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">短時間內多次提交錯誤請求，已被系統暫時限制。請修正請求參數，等限制期結束後重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109430</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">帳戶存在進行中的 TWAP 委託。請等待或取消現有 TWAP 委託後再提交。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109500</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">服務端內部錯誤。若持續出現請稍後重試或聯繫技術支持。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109701</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">網絡請求異常。請檢查網絡連接並重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110203</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">可平倉數量不足。請減少平倉數量或等待掛單成交後重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110206</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">止盈/止損訂單數量已達限制。請先取消不再需要的掛單，再提交新訂單。USDT-M 永續合約的最大掛單數量可透過 <a href=\"#/zh-tw/Swap/Market%20Data/%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E8%A6%8F%E5%89%87\">GET /openApi/swap/v1/tradingRules（交易規則）</a> 返回的 <code>maxNumOrder</code> 查詢。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110280</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">該交易對已暫停開倉。請關注官方公告獲取恢復時間。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110284</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">無法使用保障止損功能。請確認該交易對和帳戶是否支援。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110287</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">當前槓桿下的最大持倉價值已達上限。請降低槓桿或減少下單金額。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110400</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">提交的訂單參數不符合要求。請核對價格、數量等是否在有效範圍內。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110402</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">委託價格不合法，須大於最小價格限制。請調整委託價格。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110406</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">該倉位已存在止損掛單。請先取消現有止損訂單再設置新的。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110407</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">該倉位已存在止盈掛單。請先取消現有止盈訂單再設置新的。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110411</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">多單止損價應低於當前價格。請根據持倉方向重新設置止損價。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110412</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">空單止損價應高於當前價格。請根據持倉方向重新設置止損價。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110413</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">多單止盈價應高於當前價格。請根據持倉方向重新設置止盈價。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110414</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">空單止盈價應低於當前價格。請根據持倉方向重新設置止盈價。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110415</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">追蹤止損的回調比例低於最小值。請提高回調比例。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110418</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">追蹤止損的回調比例超出最大值。請降低回調比例。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110419</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">空單追蹤止損的激活價格應高於當前最新價/標記價。請調高激活價格。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110420</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">多單追蹤止損的激活價格應低於當前最新價/標記價。請調低激活價格。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110422</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">單筆訂單數量低於最小值。請增加下單數量。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110424</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">下單數量或金額超過當前可用資產。請降低下單數量或增加可用資產。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110425</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">訂單數量不符合合約精度或步長要求。請根據合約信息調整數量。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110426</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">提交的訂單參數不符合要求。請核對參數後重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110427</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">止損限價（SL limit price）低於允許的最小值。請調高止損限價。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110428</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">止損限價（SL limit price）高於允許的最大值。請調低止損限價。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">110500</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">訂單系統繁忙，請稍後重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">112414</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">倉位總額已達平台上限。請減少持倉後再嘗試開倉。</td></tr></tbody></table>","<div id=\"cat-spot\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;color:#303133;border-bottom:2px solid #409eff;padding-bottom:6px;display:inline-block;\">現貨錯誤碼</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;color:#909399;font-size:13px;\">現貨行情查詢及交易接口返回的錯誤。</p></div><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 32px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\"><thead><tr style=\"background:#f5f7fa;text-align:left;\"><th style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;width:100px;font-weight:600;\">錯誤碼</th><th style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-weight:600;\">說明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100202</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">帳戶餘額不足，無法完成下單。請補充資金後重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100204</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">查詢的數據不存在。常見原因：<ul style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0;padding-left:18px;\"><li>交易對（symbol）不存在或拼寫錯誤</li><li>查詢的時間範圍內無 K 線或成交數據</li><li>查詢時間跨度過大</li></ul></td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100400</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">請求參數錯誤或資源不存在。常見原因：<ul style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0;padding-left:18px;\"><li>缺少必填參數（如 timestamp）</li><li>symbol 格式不正確（應為 BTC-USDT 格式）</li><li>interval 值不合法</li><li>訂單不存在</li></ul></td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100404</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">訂單不存在。訂單可能已成交或已撤銷。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100410</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">短時間內錯誤請求過多，已觸發限流。請修正請求參數後重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100421</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">請求被拒絕。常見原因：<ul style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0;padding-left:18px;\"><li>LIMIT 掛單數量已達上限（1000）</li><li>交易對不支持通過 API 下單</li></ul></td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100440</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">下單價格偏離市場價過大，觸發價格保護機制。請調整價格至合理範圍。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100441</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">帳戶狀態異常或需完成高級身份認證。請完成 KYC 認證或聯繫客服。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100490</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">現貨交易對已下線。請通過 /openApi/spot/v1/common/symbols 查詢交易對狀態。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100500</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">系統繁忙或查詢失敗，請稍後重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101402</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">該帳戶不支持此交易對的交易。請確認帳戶權限和交易對狀態。</td></tr></tbody></table>","<div id=\"cat-account\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;color:#303133;border-bottom:2px solid #409eff;padding-bottom:6px;display:inline-block;\">帳號 / 錢包 / 代理錯誤碼</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;color:#909399;font-size:13px;\">帳號管理、錢包充提、代理相關接口返回的錯誤。</p></div><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 32px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\"><thead><tr style=\"background:#f5f7fa;text-align:left;\"><th style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;width:100px;font-weight:600;\">錯誤碼</th><th style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-weight:600;\">說明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100202</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">資產不足，無法完成操作。請補充資金後重試。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100400</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">請求參數無效。常見原因：<ul style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0;padding-left:18px;\"><li>金額須大於 0</li><li>主帳戶不存在</li><li>缺少必填參數（如 uid）</li></ul></td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100403</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">當前帳戶不是主帳戶（UID 不匹配）。該接口僅限主帳戶調用，子帳戶無權限。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100437</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">幣種不存在或查詢充值地址失敗。請確認幣種名稱拼寫正確。</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100450</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">當前帳戶信息不正確（如子帳戶 UID 無效）。請確認帳戶信息。</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100500</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">系統繁忙，請稍後重試。</td></tr></tbody></table>"],"en":["<div style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:22px;color:#303133;\">API Error Code Reference</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;color:#606266;font-size:14px;\">All error codes returned by BingX OpenAPI, categorized by service module.</p></div>","<div style=\"margin-bottom:24px;padding:14px 18px;background:#f5f7fa;border-radius:6px;\"><b style=\"font-size:13px;color:#303133;\">Quick Navigation:</b><br><span style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 14px 8px 0;\"><a href=\"#cat-http\" style=\"color:#409eff;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;\">HTTP Error Codes</a> <span style=\"color:#c0c4cc;\">(8)</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 14px 8px 0;\"><a href=\"#cat-gateway\" style=\"color:#409eff;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;\">Common Error Codes</a> <span style=\"color:#c0c4cc;\">(10)</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 14px 8px 0;\"><a href=\"#cat-futures\" style=\"color:#409eff;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;\">Futures Error Codes</a> <span style=\"color:#c0c4cc;\">(72)</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 14px 8px 0;\"><a href=\"#cat-spot\" style=\"color:#409eff;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;\">Spot Error Codes</a> <span style=\"color:#c0c4cc;\">(11)</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0 14px 8px 0;\"><a href=\"#cat-account\" style=\"color:#409eff;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;\">Account / Wallet / Agent Error Codes</a> <span style=\"color:#c0c4cc;\">(6)</span></span></div>","<div id=\"cat-http\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;color:#303133;border-bottom:2px solid #409eff;padding-bottom:6px;display:inline-block;\">HTTP Error Codes</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;color:#909399;font-size:13px;\">HTTP-level status codes applicable to all endpoints.</p></div><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 32px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\"><thead><tr style=\"background:#f5f7fa;text-align:left;\"><th style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;width:100px;font-weight:600;\">Code</th><th style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-weight:600;\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">400</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Bad Request — Invalid request format.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">401</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Unauthorized — Invalid API Key.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">403</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Forbidden — You do not have access to the requested resource.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">404</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Not Found — The requested resource does not exist.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">418</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Continued access after receiving 429, IP has been banned. Stop requests and wait.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">429</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Too Many Requests — Requests are too frequent, rate-limited by the system.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">500</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Internal Server Error — Internal server error.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">504</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Gateway Timeout — The server failed to get a response; further confirmation required.</td></tr></tbody></table>","<div id=\"cat-gateway\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;color:#303133;border-bottom:2px solid #409eff;padding-bottom:6px;display:inline-block;\">Common Error Codes</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;color:#909399;font-size:13px;\">Applies to all endpoints. Returned by the gateway layer before the request reaches backend services.</p></div><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 32px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\"><thead><tr style=\"background:#f5f7fa;text-align:left;\"><th style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;width:100px;font-weight:600;\">Code</th><th style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-weight:600;\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100001</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Request signature verification failed. Verify the signature algorithm, parameter order, and API secret.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100004</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">The API key does not have the required trading permission. Enable it in the API Key management page.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100400</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Request routing error. Common reasons:<ul style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0;padding-left:18px;\"><li>API endpoint does not exist — verify the path in the API docs</li><li>Incorrect request method (GET/POST)</li></ul></td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100404</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">The requested API path does not exist or the request method is incorrect. Verify the URL and method.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100410</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Request rate limit exceeded. Reduce request frequency and retry after the cooldown period.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100412</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Request is missing the signature parameter. Include a valid signature in your request.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100413</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">API Key is incorrect or missing. Ensure:<ul style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0;padding-left:18px;\"><li>The API Key is correct and not deleted</li><li>X-BX-APIKEY is set in the HTTP request header</li></ul></td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100419</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">The request IP is not in the API Key IP whitelist. Check IP whitelist settings.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100421</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Null timestamp or timestamp mismatch with server time. Ensure your local clock is synchronized.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">100500</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">System busy. Please retry later.</td></tr></tbody></table>","<div id=\"cat-futures\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;color:#303133;border-bottom:2px solid #409eff;padding-bottom:6px;display:inline-block;\">Futures Error Codes</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;color:#909399;font-size:13px;\">Errors related to USDT-M and Coin-M perpetual futures.</p></div><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 32px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\"><thead><tr style=\"background:#f5f7fa;text-align:left;\"><th style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;width:100px;font-weight:600;\">Code</th><th style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-weight:600;\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101201</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">The current position is too large for the requested leverage. Reduce position size before adjusting.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101202</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Order value is below the contract minimum. Increase the order value; query contract info for the minimum.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101204</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Insufficient margin to place the order. Add margin, lower leverage, or reduce order size.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101205</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">No position exists to close. Query positions first to confirm a position exists.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101206</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Account available balance is insufficient. Add funds and retry.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101209</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">The maximum position value for the current leverage has been reached. Lower leverage or reduce order size.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101210</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Account belongs to a restricted region or account status is abnormal. Verify account status or contact support.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101211</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Order price exceeds the allowed range (too high or too low). Adjust the price to within the allowed range.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101212</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Available balance is insufficient for this order. Reduce order amount or add funds.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101214</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Funding fee settlement is in progress. Retry in a few seconds.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101215</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Post Only order was cancelled because it would have been filled immediately. Adjust the price or use a different order type.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101219</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Account assets are being processed and temporarily unavailable. Please retry later.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101222</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Current leverage risk is too high. Lower leverage and retry.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101253</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Insufficient margin (including adjustable margin). Add funds or reduce order notional.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101290</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">A Reduce Only order can only decrease an existing position. Ensure the order does not exceed the current position size.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101400</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Order parameter validation failed. Possible reasons:<ul style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0;padding-left:18px;\"><li>Order amount or quantity below minimum</li><li>TP/SL price does not match position direction</li><li>Duplicate clientOrderID</li><li>Trading pair suspended</li></ul></td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101412</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Account information has changed. Please refresh and try again.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101413</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Currently in non-trading hours. Retry during trading hours.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101414</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Leverage exceeds limit — may exceed maximum for the trading pair, be restricted during certain periods, or non-crypto contracts may not support OpenAPI one-way mode.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101415</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">This trading pair is suspended from opening positions or trading. Check announcements for resumption.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101419</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Pending orders reached the upper limit. Cancel some pending orders first.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101429</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">This order exceeds the current position limit. Reduce order size or check the position limit.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101434</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Trial Fund accounts cannot hold both long and short positions. Close existing position first.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101460</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">For long positions, the order price must be higher than the estimated liquidation price.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101461</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">For short positions, the order price must be lower than the estimated liquidation price.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101479</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">The position is not in Isolated Margin Mode. Switch to Isolated Margin Mode first.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101481</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">The clientOrderID has already been used. Use a unique clientOrderID for each new order.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101483</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Advanced identity verification (KYC) is required to use this feature.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101484</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Account belongs to a restricted region or advanced identity verification is required.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">101485</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">The closing order size is below the minimum. Increase the closing size.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">102201</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Order was canceled because filling it may result in negative account assets. Add margin or reduce order size.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">104103</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Cannot switch position mode while positions or pending orders exist. Close all positions and cancel all orders first.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">104108</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">One-way position mode does not support separate isolated margin mode. Switch to Hedge mode first.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">104414</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">This feature is not available for copy trading lead traders. Use a non-lead-trader account.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">104424</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Currently in non-trading hours. Retry during trading hours.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109201</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">The same order number was submitted more than once in a short period. Use a unique clientOrderID.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109400</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Invalid request parameters. Common reasons:<ul style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0;padding-left:18px;\"><li>symbol format error (must end with -USDT or -USDC)</li><li>Missing required parameters (symbol / timestamp / side / type, etc.)</li><li>Parameter value out of allowed range (limit, interval, positionSide, etc.)</li><li>Invalid or skewed timestamp</li><li>Query time range exceeds limit (e.g. 7 days or 90 days)</li><li>Position mode mismatch (e.g. PositionSide must be BOTH in one-way mode)</li></ul></td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109403</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Request blocked by risk control — rate too high or cancellation rate exceeded. Fix the request and retry after the restriction period.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109417</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">This trading pair is in pre-launch status and not yet open. Check the contract list for opening time.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109418</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Trading pair is offline and cannot be ordered through OpenAPI. Check status via /openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109420</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">No position exists for the specified symbol. Query position information first.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109421</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">The specified order does not exist — it may have been filled, cancelled, or the order ID is incorrect.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109425</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">The trading pair does not exist or is not supported. Call /openApi/swap/v2/quote/contracts to verify.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109429</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Too many invalid requests in a short period; temporarily restricted. Fix the root cause and retry later.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109430</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">The account has pending TWAP orders. Wait for or cancel existing TWAP orders first.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109500</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Internal server error. If it persists, please retry later or contact support.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fafafa;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-weight:700;color:#303133;vertical-align:top;\">109701</td><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #ebeef5;color:#303133;\">Network request exception. Check your network connection and retry.</td></tr><tr style=\"\"><td style=\"padding:10px 16px;border:1px s