module.exports = {"type":"REST","title":"批量下單","en":"Place multiple orders","api":{"uri":"/openApi/swap/v2/trade/batchOrders","method":"POST","rate-limitation":"5/second","ip-rate-limitation":"3","payload":{"batchOrders":"[{\"symbol\": \"ETH-USDT\",\"type\": \"MARKET\",\"side\": \"BUY\",\"positionSide\": \"LONG\",\"quantity\": 1},{\"symbol\": \"BTC-USDT\",\"type\": \"MARKET\",\"side\": \"BUY\",\"positionSide\": \"LONG\",\"quantity\": 0.001}]"},"responseBody":{"code":0,"msg":"","data":{"orders":[{"symbol":"ID-USDT","orderId":1736010300483712300,"side":"SELL","positionSide":"LONG","type":"MARKET","clientOrderId":"","workingType":""}]}},"request":{"info":["<div><li>具體訂單條件規則，與普通下單一致</li></div>","<div><li>batchOrders是數組</li></div>","<div><li>批量下單的簽名可能稍微複雜，但是不用擔心, 可以參照以下四個步驟:</li></div>","<div><li>1. 把你的整個request body 變成 request query string如下</li></div>","<div><code>原始的 parameters: batchOrders=[{\"symbol\":\"ETH-USDT\",\"type\":\"MARKET\",\"side\":\"BUY\",\"positionSide\":\"LONG\",\"quantity\":1},{\"symbol\":\"BTC-USDT\",\"type\":\"MARKET\",\"side\":\"BUY\",\"positionSide\":\"LONG\",\"quantity\":0.001}]&timestamp=1692956597902</code></div>","<div><li>2. 對原始的 parameters 進行簽名</li></div>","<div><code>得到簽名: bab521321a62a1381a76b485b92dd0f4a8b16b4616cfa4c75ffba899f80dfc86</code></div>","<div><li>3.對請求參數的每一個值都進行URL編碼,比如字段batchOrders的值,這裡只對值value進行URL編碼，不對字段key進行URL編碼,也不是對整個原始的parameters字串進行URL編碼，這裡有個特殊字段:timestamp的value也不用URL編碼，然後逐個替換成如下:</li></div>","<div><code>經過URL編碼value替換後: batchOrders=%5B%7B%22symbol%22%3A%22ETH-USDT%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22MARKET%22%2C%22side%22%3A%22BUY%22%2C%22positionSide%22%3A%22LONG%22%2C%22quantity%22%3A1%7D%2C%7B%22symbol%22%3A%22BTC-USDT%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22MARKET%22%2C%22side%22%3A%22BUY%22%2C%22positionSide%22%3A%22LONG%22%2C%22quantity%22%3A0.001%7D%5D&timestamp=1692956597902</code></div>","<div><li> 4. 最後的請求應該如下</li></div>","<div><code>POST https://open-api.bingx.com/openApi/swap/v2/trade/batchOrders?batchOrders=%5B%7B%22symbol%22%3A%22ETH-USD