 transactions to place orders"},{"name":"timestamp","type":"int64","required_zh":"是","required_en":"Yes","values":"","zh":"請求的時間戳，單位:毫秒","en":"request timestamp, unit: millisecond"},{"name":"recvWindow","type":"int64","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"請求有效時間空窗值, 單位:毫秒","en":"Request valid time window value, Unit: milliseconds"}]},"response":{"info":"","info_en":"","list":[{"name":"symbol","type":"string","values":"","zh":"交易對, 例如: BTC-USDT","en":"trading pair, for example: BTC-USDT"},{"name":"side","type":"string","values":"","zh":"買賣方向","en":"buying and selling direction"},{"name":"type","type":"string","values":"","zh":"LIMIT：限價單/MARKET：市價單/STOP_MARKET：市價止損單/TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET：市價止盈單/STOP：限價止損單/TAKE_PROFIT：限價止盈單/TRIGGER_LIMIT：計劃委託單限價單/TRIGGER_MARKET：計劃委託市價單/TRAILING_STOP_MARKET:追蹤委託單/TRAILING_TP_SL:移動止盈止損","en":"LIMIT: Limit Order / MARKET: Market Order / STOP_MARKET: Stop Market Order / TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET: Take Profit Market Order / STOP: Stop Limit Order / TAKE_PROFIT: Take Profit Limit Order / TRIGGER_LIMIT: Stop Limit Order with Trigger / TRIGGER_MARKET: Stop Market Order with Trigger / TRAILING_STOP_MARKET: Trailing Stop Market Order / TRAILING_TP_SL: Trailing TakeProfit or StopLoss"},{"name":"positionSide","type":"string","values":"","zh":"持倉方向，單項持倉必填BOTH，雙向持倉僅可選擇 LONG 或 SHORT，為空時默認LONG","en":"Position direction, required for single position as BOTH, for both long and short positions only LONG or SHORT can be chosen, defaults to LONG if empty"},{"name":"reduceOnly","type":"string","values":"","zh":"true, false; 單項持倉模式下默認false；雙開持倉模式下不接受此參數","en":"true, false; Default value is false for single position mode; This parameter is not accepted for both long and short positions mode"},{"name":"orderID","type":"string","values":"","zh":"訂單號","en":"Order ID"},{"name":"workingType","type":"string","values":"","zh":"stopPrice觸發價價格類型：MARK_PRICE、CONTRACT_PRICE、INDEX_PRICE，默認MARK_PRICE。當type為STOP或STOP_MARKET，以及stopGuaranteed為true的時候，workingType只能為CONTRACT_PRICE。","en":"Customized order ID for users. The system will convert this field to lowercase."},{"name":"clientOrderId","type":"string","values":"","zh":"用戶自定義訂單ID，系統會將該字段轉為英文小寫","en":"true: Enables the guaranteed stop-loss and take-profit feature; false: Disables the feature. The guaranteed stop-loss feature is not enabled by default. Supported order types include: STOP_MARKET: Market stop-loss order / TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET: Market take-profit order / STOP: Limit stop-loss order / TAKE_PROFIT: Limit take-profit order / TRIGGER_LIMIT: Stop-limit order with trigger / TRIGGER_MARKET: Market order with trigger for stop-loss."},{"name":"stopGuaranteed","type":"string","values":"","zh":"true：啟用保證止盈停損功能；false：不啟用保證停損功能。預設不啟用保證止盈止損功能。支援的訂單類型type有：STOP_MARKET：市價止損單/TAKE_PROFIT_MARKET：市價止盈單/STOP：限價止損單/TAKE_PROFIT：限價止盈單/TRIGGER_LIMIT：計劃委託單限價單/TRIGGER_MARKET：計劃計劃委託市價單。","en":"Order status"},{"name":"status","type":"string","values":"NEW/PENDING/FILLED/PARTIALLYFILLED/CANCELLED/FAILED","zh":"訂單狀態: NEW(新訂單)/PENDING(委託中)/FILLED(完全成交)/PARTIALLYFILLED(部分成交)/CANCELLED(已撤銷)/FAILED(失敗)","en":"Order status: NEW(New order)/PENDING(Pending)/FILLED(Filled)/PARTIALLYFILLED(Partially filled)/CANCELLED(Cancelled)/FAILED(Failed)"},{"name":"avgPrice","type":"string","values":"","zh":"平均成交價，type=MARKET時有值","en":"Transaction quantity, coins"}]},"error":{"info":"","info_en":"","list":[]}},"info":{"en":[{"type":"div","info":"Signature Verification: Yes"},{"type":"div","info":"Applicable Accounts: Master and Sub Accounts"},{"type":"div","info":"API Key Permission: Professional Futures Trading"},{"type":"div","info":"The current account performs batch order operations on the specified symbol contract"},{"type":"div","info":"Error Codes: See <a href=\"#/en/Quick%20Start/Error%20Code%20Reference?anchor=cat-futures\" style=\"color:#409eff;\">Error Code Reference — Futures Error Codes</a>"}],"zh":[{"type":"div","info":"是否驗簽: 是"},{"type":"div","info":"適用帳戶: 子母帳戶"},{"type":"div","info":"API Key權限: 專業合約交易"},{"type":"div","info":"當前賬戶在指定symbol合約上進行批量下單操作"},{"type":"div","info":"錯誤碼：請參考 <a href=\"#/zh-tw/Quick%20Start/Error%20Code%20Reference?anchor=cat-futures\" style=\"color:#409eff;\">錯誤碼參考 — 合約錯誤碼</a>"}]}}


